# profile: example   -- a template for your own course.
#
# Copy to 60-<name>.list, list one hostname per line, then add <name> to
# PROFILES in classnet.conf and run `classnet apply`.
#
# Two things to know before you write one:
#
#  * Entries match subdomains. `example.com` admits every *.example.com. That
#    is usually more than you meant -- name the exact hosts instead, and put
#    anything you want excluded in deny.list, which wins.
#  * A site is not reachable until something resolves it through this router.
#    If a page half-loads, run `classnet debug on`, reload it, then
#    `classnet log` to see exactly which host was refused.
#
# pypi.org
# files.pythonhosted.org
